Steam number and artwork names change. A shortcut made before, which starts shadPS4.exe itself, is still the game's:
it shows (Update Steam), and Y Update Steam writes it again (shortcuts.outdated()).

Changelog: 30-10-2026 14:49:38

Added. Hold View and Menu together for two seconds to quit a game (core's play mode): shadPS4 closes as its window
would, from Steam's library, X Play or without Steam. The line at the bottom says so when a game starts ("In the game,
hold View and Menu together to quit."), and Your games' information and the wiki chapter. A short press still opens
shadPS4's own quit window.

