29-10-2026): the steam.exe -silent it started never signed in, so a game's Play and Open Steam did nothing until
Steam was started by hand. The status line says Steam was started again, signed in.

Changelog: 29-10-2026 22:08:01

Added. Several packages at once (owner, 29-10-2026: not one by one; "we can build an interface"): in RB Packages, Y
marks a package and X unpacks the marked ones, or every package of the open folder; one place for all, then a page of
what each one does there (a folder of its own, beside its game, its folder there already, the same folder as another,
no package), where A takes one in or leaves it out and lets an update replace the one there; X unpacks them one after
the other, the games first, then their updates and add-ons, and the status line sums it up (extract.read_all(),
extract.plan()).

